  "notes": [
   "Paths that are not ASCII, and a rename from the composed spelling of a name to its decomposed spelling. The two café pages differ by nothing a normalising filesystem can see, so they are never both in the tree at once; the Cyrillic module name and the en dash in a note are the two a Windows console and a shell quoting layer have to survive. The paths are written with escapes in the generator so that no editor or git filter gets to choose the normalisation form."
  ]
